    "perplexity": {
      "description": "Greatest Hits is a 2026 Def Leppard compilation that gathers the band’s most familiar and enduring rock anthems onto a newly mastered 1LP vinyl release from Mercury. The set was issued in standard black vinyl and a tour-exclusive blood-red marbled edition, with artwork tied to the band’s 2026 tour. The track selection focuses on the songs that defined Def Leppard’s global rise and arena-rock identity, including “Pour Some Sugar on Me,” “Hysteria,” “Photograph,” and “Love Bites.”\n\nAs a concise career-spanning anthology, Greatest Hits highlights the melodic hard rock and polished hooks that made Def Leppard one of the most successful bands of their era. The compilation balances early breakthroughs like “Bringin’ On the Heartbreak” and “Foolin’” with later staples such as “When Love and Hate Collide,” offering a streamlined overview of the group’s evolution from muscular 1980s rock to widescreen power-pop metal.",
